/** 功能按钮网格：点击直接使用并关闭弹层；长按拖动调整顺序，排序前 4 个显示在播放页。 */
@Composable
private fun PlayerActionsGridSheetContent(
    actions: List<PlayerQuickAction>,
    onActionsChange: (List<PlayerQuickAction>) -> Unit,
    onActionClick: (PlayerQuickAction) -> Unit,
) {
    var draggingIndex by remember { mutableStateOf(-1) }
    var dragOffset by remember { mutableStateOf(Offset.Zero) }
    val cellRects = remember { mutableMapOf<Int, Rect>() }
    val currentActions by rememberUpdatedState(actions)
    val gapPx = with(LocalDensity.current) { 6.dp.toPx() }

    Column(
        modifier = Modifier
            .fillMaxWidth()
            .padding(horizontal = 12.dp),
        verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(10.dp),
    ) {
        Text(
            text = stringResource(R.string.player_actions_hint),
            style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall,
            color = Color.White.copy(alpha = 0.62f),
        )
        actions.chunked(GRID_COLUMNS).forEachIndexed { rowIndex, rowActions ->
            Row(
                modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),
                horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(10.dp),
            ) {
                rowActions.forEachIndexed { colIndex, action ->
                    val index = rowIndex * GRID_COLUMNS + colIndex
                    val isDragging = draggingIndex == index
                    Column(
                        horizontalAlignment = Alignment.CenterHorizontally,
                        modifier = Modifier
                            .clip(RoundedCornerShape(12.dp))
                            .background(
                                if (isDragging) {
                                    MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary.copy(alpha = 0.22f)
                                } else {
                                    Color.Transparent
                                },
                            )
                            .graphicsLayer {
                                translationX = if (isDragging) dragOffset.x else 0f
                                translationY = if (isDragging) dragOffset.y else 0f
                                val scale = if (isDragging) 1.1f else 1f
                                scaleX = scale
                                scaleY = scale
                            }
                            .onGloballyPositioned { cellRects[index] = it.boundsInRoot() }
                            .pointerInput(Unit) {
                                detectDragGesturesAfterLongPress(
                                    onDragStart = {
                                        draggingIndex = index
                                        dragOffset = Offset.Zero
                                    },
                                    onDragEnd = {
                                        draggingIndex = -1
                                        dragOffset = Offset.Zero
                                    },
                                    onDragCancel = {
                                        draggingIndex = -1
                                        dragOffset = Offset.Zero
                                    },
                                    onDrag = { change, amount ->
                                        change.consume()
                                        if (draggingIndex < 0) {
                                            return@detectDragGesturesAfterLongPress
                                        }
                                        dragOffset += amount
                                        val from = draggingIndex
                                        val fromRect = cellRects[from]
                                            ?: return@detectDragGesturesAfterLongPress
                                        val draggedCenter = fromRect.center + dragOffset
                                        val target = cellRects.entries
                                            .firstOrNull { (key, rect) ->
                                                key != from &&
                                                    rect.inflate(gapPx).contains(draggedCenter)
                                            }?.key
                                        if (target != null) {
                                            val newList = currentActions.toMutableList()
                                            newList.add(target, newList.removeAt(from))
                                            onActionsChange(newList)
                                            // 交换后保持拖拽项一直跟随手指
                                            dragOffset += fromRect.center -
                                                (cellRects[target] ?: fromRect).center
                                            draggingIndex = target
                                        }
                                    },
                                )
                            }
                            .clickable { onActionClick(action) }
                            .padding(vertical = 12.dp),
                    ) {
                        Icon(
                            imageVector = action.icon(),
                            contentDescription = null,
                            tint = Color.White,
                            modifier = Modifier.size(26.dp),
                        )
                        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(6.dp))
                        Text(
                            text = stringResource(action.labelRes()),
                            style = MaterialTheme.typography.labelSmall,
                            color = Color.White,
                            maxLines = 1,
                        )
                    }
                }
                repeat(GRID_COLUMNS - rowActions.size) {
                    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.weight(1f))
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
